    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Outlaw · уровень 9</b></p><p>You move through the wild as if it were your home.<br>Swift Passage. Difficult Terrain doesn’t cost you extra movement.<br>Climber. You gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed.<br>Powerful Shot. When you use Steady Aim using a<br>Ranged weapon with the Heavy property, you may add an additional 1d6 to your Sneak Attack damage.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Урон добавлять только после Steady Aim тяжёлым дальнобойным оружием.</li></ul>"
